# Rules for AI Agent in this repository

You MUST follow these rules on every prompt:
1. ALWAYS read `index.md` first before executing any file discovery, explore subagents, or search tools.
2. If fixing a bug, jump to the Symptom Triage Map at `index.md:L117` and inspect ONLY the primary files listed. Respect the "Scope & Blast Radius" column so you do not waste tokens sweeping unrelated modules.
3. If implementing or editing a feature, jump to the Code Map at `index.md:L100`.
4. Only run broad greps or directory searches if the feature or symptom is completely missing from `index.md`.

